{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">元朗狗咬狗事件，增至兩隻狗死亡，涉襲擊狗隻已被漁護署接管，未找到狗主。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[早前報道]</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">元朗鬧市有狗懷疑咬死另外兩隻狗，被漁護署接管。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DOG-1830.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026C3d8EeGbyM1786965079.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DOG-1830.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上片段見到，一隻體型較大的啡色狗，緊咬著一隻體型較小的白色狗，大狗放下小狗後，小狗身上有血漬，已無動靜，旁邊有人情緒激動，坐在地上。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DOG-1830_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026dTA1pyGt2G1786965051.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DOG-1830_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">警方指下午近3時有人報案，指元朗YOHO MALL公共運輸交匯處附近發生狗咬狗。據了解，其中一隻被咬的小狗送到附近獸醫診所後證實死亡，而大狗暫時由漁護署接管。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1189600-%E5%85%83%E6%9C%97YOHO%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%97%E5%A4%B1%E6%8E%A7%E5%92%AC%E6%AD%BB%E7%B4%B0%E7%8B%97%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%B4%E9%AE%AE%E8%A1%80%E6%B7%8B%E6%BC%93%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E8%B7%AA%E5%9C%B0%E7%97%9B%E5%93%AD%E8%A1%97%E5%9D%8A%E7%97%9B%E6%96%A5%E5%A4%A7%E7%8B%97%E7%8B%97%E4%B8%BB%E7%84%A1%E5%BD%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\">元朗YOHO大狗失控咬死細狗 現場鮮血淋漓有人跪地痛哭 街坊痛斥大狗狗主無影</a></p><h1 class=\"article-title\" style=\"text-align: left; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.14rem; padding: 0px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: NotoSans-Medium; font-size: 0.28rem; line-height: 1.3; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></h1><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T11:19:31.174016+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":253,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}